          "python",
          "1. Try clause 1: path(a,d) :- edge(a,d).\n   -> edge(a,d)? No match. FAIL.\n   -> Backtrack.\n\n2. Try clause 2: path(a,d) :- edge(a,Z), path(Z,d).\n   -> edge(a,Z)? Try edge(a,b): Z=b\n      -> path(b,d)?\n         -> Try clause 1: edge(b,d)? YES! SUCCESS.\n         -> Solution found: a -> b -> d\n\n   -> Backtrack to edge(a,Z). Try edge(a,c): Z=c\n      -> path(c,d)?\n         -> Try clause 1: edge(c,d)? YES! SUCCESS.\n         -> Solution found: a -> c -> d"
        ]
